WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.938
Let's freeze the ribosome mid-step.

00:00:02.333 --> 00:00:03.261
Look at the A site.

00:00:03.598 --> 00:00:05.119
A new tRNA just came in with

00:00:05.166 --> 00:00:06.094
its amino acid.

00:00:06.385 --> 00:00:07.267
Now the P site.

00:00:07.557 --> 00:00:09.902
Its tRNA holds the growing chain, and

00:00:09.949 --> 00:00:11.412
the peptide bond forms here.

00:00:12.039 --> 00:00:12.979
Now the E site.

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:15.545
This tRNA is empty, and it's on

00:00:15.591 --> 00:00:16.253
its way out.

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:18.366
Like a snapshot of a relay race.

00:00:18.993 --> 00:00:20.514
In at A, bond at P, out

00:00:20.549 --> 00:00:21.001
from E.

00:00:21.628 --> 00:00:22.952
Now try the question again.
